{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6e0a37ad52139dc984107608d807c5b80f11b881e9f97e9a6aff7c7cd0f28f2a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_b:2_4_046_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bc0e870c62fe13cb4920fdf7aca7cae2747572d4a6fd2a5fba343a064ff52ae",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_b:2_4_046_01_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6a47b66227513ac48cadfe34b39516a6a5507476ed1be1e70a641f6175032f6",
      "text": "为了接下来的拍摄，我刚刚去了趟水族馆。\n那里已经开始举办结合节分主题的展览了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_b:2_4_046_01_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:000769c02c57e8a92b34e2ca2c981aabb5e13adca25311a3160fbb8643fc898c",
      "text": "那真不错呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_b:2_4_046_01_09_b:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6de8bd3db04ea7fa03a62488d7081e55ea3f1c8804084a97fb86f2e8ff8e5f9",
      "text": "感觉会很有参考价值呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_b:2_4_046_01_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:646deae9d055835119e6eeefb4b19aab44d079b54c416f7127f8b7cb8aceb13d",
      "text": "是的！海洋里其实也有许多与“鬼”相关的生物哦。比如鬼鲉、鬼海星……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_b:2_4_046_01_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e29216401c05f17569af6374670bf02a8db0884b87eafbbf48eefdd8fc39853",
      "text": "哪怕是那大名鼎鼎的魔鬼鱼，其标准日文名也是鬼蝠鲼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_b:2_4_046_01_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8134e9347179df4e1f65820809e3d1f63e383a4d940f41be5019ff2ccdd80351",
      "text": "在这次的工作中，我也想结合“鬼”这一主题，\n将大海的魅力传达给大家！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_b:2_4_046_01_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2881f201caa231d4be6d1c9d66b09732f0c320c6c75e72dd39433ceec7971ea2",
      "text": "在那之前，我想试着邀请一同参与工作的各位，\n去那家水族馆看一看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:046chr_401_2_4_046_01_09_b:2_4_046_01_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa23844e7b0b0e49b8d7411b4a493449376fb68854826a4c3db16759c98a879e",
      "text": "可以的话制作人也请务必赏光。\n日程定下来后我会联系您的。那就先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
